    "summary": "Two paragraphs of Strength from Death are replaced. Lethal Intent: once the opposing Shooting phase is over, if that phase cost you at least one Ynnari unit, pick one of your Infantry or Mounted Ynnari units that stood no more than 6 inches from a unit you lost; that unit may take a Normal move capped at D6+1 inches. Lethal Surge: once each turn, a Ynnari unit of yours carrying out Fade Back (an Agile Manoeuvre) may surge as far as D6+1 inches in place of its normal move.",
